## Mechanical gates

Where a check can be a command, it is a command with a documented return code,
and it runs in CI. Prose judgment is reserved for what a command cannot decide.

| Gate | Command | Refuses |
|---|---|---|
| {{GATE}} | `{{COMMAND}}` | {{WHAT_IT_REFUSES}} |

