## Claims and evidence

- **No claim without a same-turn receipt.** "Passing", "fixed", "shipped" need
  the tool output that shows it, in the same turn.
- **Never report an identifier you did not read back** — issue numbers, run
  ids, shas, commit trailers.
- If a tool result arrives truncated, any claim resting on the elided region is
  unverified: re-run a targeted check before asserting it.

---

## Secrets

- Never commit credentials. `{{SECRETS_FILE}}` is the only place they live, and
  it is not in this repository.
- Never paste a credential into an issue, a chat, a log or a commit message —
  including in a screenshot.
